  "notes": "Large low-rise institutional/commercial complex (footprint ~52x49m). Three abutting blocks: a tan sandstone-ashlar block (left) with tall narrow strip windows, a pale-grey modernist block (centre, RE/MAX signage) with a vertical slot window, and a grey metal-clad block (right). All ~2 storeys, flat roofs. Fronted by a green metal railing (bar fence) over a low kerb, with hedges and flower planters. Colours eyeballed from ref. Environment: silver / blue / white sedans parked across the street, a large oak plus two palms and small oaks, a low green hedge/bush row along the verge, terracotta flower planters with yellow/red/purple blooms."
